### English summary

This repository publishes the %%N_ROWS%% World Heritage Irrigation Structures (WHIS) in Japan, recognized by ICID between 2014 and 2026, as Linked Open Data (Turtle, JSON-LD, GeoJSON and CSV), with source URLs for every record. It reuses schema.org, GeoSPARQL, W3C Basic Geo, DCMI Terms and DCAT, and defines a small `whis:` vocabulary only where needed (registration year, built year and its basis, facility type, water source, managing organization, irrigated area, representative point). Values that differ between official sources are left blank, and both values are recorded in a comment. Links to Wikidata (`owl:sameAs`) are added only after manual verification. Data: CC BY 4.0. Code: MIT.
